      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "Hirshleifer·Hsu·Li·创新效率：年6月末；市值中位×Patents/RDC三分；EMI=½(SH+BH)−½(SL+BL)市值加权（HHL IE·EMI·2×3）"
